flowchart TD
  X["Window t: readings of every service"] --> F{"Container fact?<br/>stopped, paused, restarting,<br/>detached, crash-looping"}
  F -- yes --> A["ALARM at once"]
  F -- no --> L{"Model level of any service<br/>at least 2 on two windows in a row?"}
  L -- yes --> A
  L -- no --> R{"Rule score of any service<br/>at least 1.25 x its line<br/>on two windows in a row?"}
  R -- yes --> A
  R -- no --> Q["Quiet: update baselines and<br/>propagation counts, keep watching"]
  A --> K["Rank, predict, diagnose"]
